{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/482ec4208c4e77e6bfc08f9f1bf07a5e.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >East of Downtown lies an abandoned island, tainted by the disgrace of the city government. After the Beta War, Island #17 was left out of the city\u2019s development plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, immigrants from &quot;Motokumo&quot;\u2014the Kumo people\u2014settled and began rebuilding the forsaken island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time, it transformed into \u201cKumo Island,\u201d the vibrant heart of East Ward, a bustling area of Downtown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Administrator sets out on a journey to &quot;Motokumo,&quot; the hometown of Toa and Satona, in search of lost fragments of memory and the history buried under power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/aa99434f7c7bab0162c40fae619464fd.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Special Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/e3223fa62f46b45f3a0684ee385590e1.avif?t=1755353702\" width=465 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode, Toa and Satona make an appearance dressed in kimonos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look at the two of them wearing Motokumo\u2019s traditional attire\u2014the kimono!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Special soundtrack and cutscene CG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/1b5a89dc76216d0b985089a6b6d3672f.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Toa Japanese Voice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode, Toa\u2019s Japanese voice acting is performed by voice actress <strong>Hasumi Ai (\u7fbd\u6f84\u611b)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of Japanese voice lines this time enhances immersion\u2014making it feel as if the characters are truly speaking <i>Kumoan</i>, the language of the Motokumo region!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, welcome to Kumo Island, Administrator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal ONE DLC \u2013 Memories of Kumo Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&gt; Download &amp; Installation Instructions</i><br>The DLC will be automatically downloaded to the proper directory via the Steam client.<br>Once you restart the game, the purchased DLC will be activated after the update screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copyright 2025 \u00a9 HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD / All Rights Reserved.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944390?t=1755353702","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944390?t=1755353702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/9a8900b12c293a4c3dc86eaf38c30fcdddd8811d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755353702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/9a8900b12c293a4c3dc86eaf38c30fcdddd8811d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755353702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/482ec4208c4e77e6bfc08f9f1bf07a5e.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >East of Downtown lies an abandoned island, tainted by the disgrace of the city government. After the Beta War, Island #17 was left out of the city\u2019s development plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, immigrants from &quot;Motokumo&quot;\u2014the Kumo people\u2014settled and began rebuilding the forsaken island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In time, it transformed into \u201cKumo Island,\u201d the vibrant heart of East Ward, a bustling area of Downtown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Administrator sets out on a journey to &quot;Motokumo,&quot; the hometown of Toa and Satona, in search of lost fragments of memory and the history buried under power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/aa99434f7c7bab0162c40fae619464fd.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Special Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/e3223fa62f46b45f3a0684ee385590e1.avif?t=1755353702\" width=465 height=568 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode, Toa and Satona make an appearance dressed in kimonos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a look at the two of them wearing Motokumo\u2019s traditional attire\u2014the kimono!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Special soundtrack and cutscene CG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/extras/1b5a89dc76216d0b985089a6b6d3672f.avif?t=1755353702\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Toa Japanese Voice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this episode, Toa\u2019s Japanese voice acting is performed by voice actress <strong>Hasumi Ai (\u7fbd\u6f84\u611b)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of Japanese voice lines this time enhances immersion\u2014making it feel as if the characters are truly speaking <i>Kumoan</i>, the language of the Motokumo region!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, welcome to Kumo Island, Administrator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal ONE DLC \u2013 Memories of Kumo Island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&gt; Download &amp; Installation Instructions</i><br>The DLC will be automatically downloaded to the proper directory via the Steam client.<br>Once you restart the game, the purchased DLC will be activated after the update screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copyright 2025 \u00a9 HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD / All Rights Reserved.</p>","developers":["HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3114280","name":"Eternal ONE"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944390/72eae08fa6d7cd188bf3863440d0914fbf23ebe7/header.jpg?t=1755353702","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257180998,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180998/movie480.mp4?t=1755339611","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180998/movie_max.mp4?t=1755339611"},"name":"heavenbyyourhand","thumbna